  "description": "A proto_version 0.7 core drives a frozen 0.6 worker with exactly 0.6's messages: it offers 0.6 on hello, the worker answers 0.6, no connect carries `auth.kind` prompt or `login_timeout`, and none of `hostkey_ask`, `hostkey_answer`, `auth_prompt` or `auth_answer` is on the wire. A rolled-back 0.6 core never sends them. The worker reports a first-use key with `hostkey`, as it did. A prompt-mode create against such a worker is refused 503 by the core before anything is placed. U2 test and U11 rig `rig-n1-positive-v06`, owed.",
  "corpus": [
    "immortality §6.4",
    "lang-arch §4.1",
    "session model §15"
  ],
  "case": {
    "socket": "conn-control",
    "messages": [
      {
        "from": "core",
        "msg": {
          "cmd": "connect",
          "target_id": "fixture-target",
          "protocol": "ssh",
          "host": "192.0.2.10",
          "port": 22,
          "user": "fixture-account",
          "auth": {
            "kind": "key",
            "key": "FIXTURE-NOT-A-KEY"
          },
          "timers": {
            "heartbeat_interval": 10000,
            "heartbeat_missed": 3,
            "keepalive_interval": 4000,
            "keepalive_count_max": 2,
            "keepalive_probe_interval": 1500,
            "connection_linger": 30000,
            "orphan_timeout": 60000,
            "idle": 900000,
            "unattended": 1800000
          },
          "buffer_bytes": 65536,
          "input_frame_max": 4096
        },
        "note": "no prompt kind and no login_timeout toward a 0.6 worker"
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "msg": {
          "event": "hostkey",
          "conn_id": "fixture-conn-1",
          "fingerprint": "SHA256:FIXTURE000000000000000000000000000000000000",
          "first_use": true
        },
        "note": "0.6's way: accept, warn, record"
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "msg": {
          "event": "connected",
          "conn_id": "fixture-conn-1"
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "core",
        "msg": {
          "cmd": "open_shell",
          "session_id": "fixture-session-a",
          "term": "xterm-256color",
          "cols": 120,
          "rows": 40,
          "open_timeout": 20000
        },
        "note": "open_timeout is 0.6's"
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "msg": {
          "event": "channel_opened",
          "session_id": "fixture-session-a",
          "session_type": "shell",
          "socket": "shell.sock"
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "core",
        "msg": {
          "cmd": "hello",
          "session_id": "fixture-session-a",
          "proto_version": "0.6",
          "last_committed_seq": 0
        },
        "note": "the core offers the peer its own version: 0.6"
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "msg": {
          "event": "hello_ack",
          "session_id": "fixture-session-a",
          "proto_version": "0.6",
          "first_buffered_seq": 1,
          "first_buffered_offset": 0,
          "current_seq": 0,
          "ended": false
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "core",
        "msg": {
          "cmd": "replay",
          "session_id": "fixture-session-a",
          "from_seq": 1
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "worker",
        "msg": {
          "event": "replay_done",
          "session_id": "fixture-session-a",
          "through_seq": 0
        }
      },
      {
        "from": "core",
        "msg": {
          "cmd": "live",
          "session_id": "fixture-session-a"
        }
      }
    ]
